<p>A plain painted wall can become the most interesting thing in a room with the right trim work: wainscoting along a dining room, board and batten in an entry, a picture-frame moulding wall in a bedroom or a full fireplace surround in the living room. These are <a href="{{ url('/services/finish-carpentry-trim') }}">finish carpentry</a> jobs, and they look good only when the layout is planned and the joints are tight. Zanini Renovations has been a fully insured carpentry and renovation business in Carleton Place since 2020.</p>

